# BREW Data Processing Utility - Transformer Module

This module applies transformations to valid data.

### Supported Transformations
- Uppercase conversion for string fields
- Type casting
- Value scaling (for numeric fields)
- Custom transformation functions

### Functionality
- Applies transformations to each valid record
- Supports multiple transformations per field
- Generates transformed data for reporting

### Usage
Included in the main pipeline. Can be used standalone for transformation.

### Example
```brev
import transformer;

transformations = {
    "name": "upper",
    "age": "to_string"
};

transformed_data = transformer.apply(records, transformations);
for each record in transformed_data {
    print(record);
}
```
